        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'utamiida gweata ghuut fuga bada sanaamajeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwahidu heedeanyu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, gala meatkweeda giijeega Israeli ak giramwaari giijasteanyu aba heeda fuga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giyeeshi, ooleeysiiniit ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, agoogeeda oondi giijeeda Israeli. Ak gearugu aniini NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ak gearukuneegwa agoogeeda oondi giijeega ea heayeeniga ea ghuusiga eeniga ea burguutka gideaba aniini gaydeadu ng'uta ak geanyarji heetiyeada sean oobadayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heedeang'wa bea wagiida gayghoah raghoonyeanda, nea sanaamajeegeagwa bea aseeta gaygwanyara ak diibigeagwa sinuuseada gaydajaksa madeeda sanaamajeegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydayiin muscheeka fuga Israeli madeeda sanaamajeega nyaawa, ak gaydaadaarda geakeagwa aba meadajeega sean bea wagiideang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiji nyooh oopiidana sean gajeenyarja mujiineedeang'wa nea heetiyeada gayghoah raghoonyeanda, nea eara heedeang'wa bea wagiida gajeenyarja ak ghoah raghoonyeanda ak sanaamajeegeagwa gajeenyarjeaweada ea goosha. Nea eara sanaamajeegeagwa gajealajaada, ak gadiyoojigeagwa gajealas uhuuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea suh sibwariin gaygoobeedeaysa bugusteang'wa, ak gajanala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak eara gwasunu gaydanung'waada suuk goobiida, nea suuk aba jeedeang'wa gayghaghu aba miyeeda ak gayghoadaarda aba jeeda darooraka buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama iyapkaadan aba jeedeaba fiisu bea eemoojiga jea ghwadardaan. Ak gayghoapkaat gidaghayi aabwardi aba gideaba gurooruunatka nyaawa manda doobiiwnata ak ghwanung'wanaan heeda. Aba gideaba ghwanung'waada ghusoodeanyu ak ghaghus sanaamajeega. Asi gayghwasit geat saawa nea gabwageat aba munyasnacheeka nyaawa ea ng'asheega munyas sina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeanal gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA mearukuni mwadaagha inyas geasimaneegwa suh munyasiin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, “Agiisana, dasa ng'eanyi aba geeshtaang'u nea giyeeni, Ashageada! Fuga Israeli aba ng'asheegeagwa munyas sean. Aba gideaba gajameewwa aba ng'uta, ea jalooda ea geeyoonung'weaka munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea sheagi muuchi gayghami aba dawni, nea dea neeki gajeabwar aba ng'uta, nea boostaaneeda ghuh aba jeeda mujiini gayghabwar jalooda, asi nih gichea dahinda nyarasteanyu gil aba badayda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muscheeka nyaawa gayghoadabwaarda aba bugusta sanaamajeega nyaawa ea heeda nyaawa bea wagiida, ea gilinyoo ea heayeeda gil, ea gilinyoo ea guumda geeta shabwaat gil, ea gilinyoo ea guumda sabiida mideawa seenga gil, ea heeda was sean siitayiida lukghumajeega nyaawa, bea shearooda ng'andit jea goohoosan sanaamajeega nyaawa bea aseecheeka. Abeeda gayghwanal gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydamiinda geatindeanyu deageal heanyaawa ak ghaadataschi ng'eanyiida nyaawa. Ghang'eada dareapcheeda mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara ea ghwahita mujiineeda Ribla mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa. Gaydanung' ghoah ng'eanyiida nyaawa raghoonyeanda ak ea mayghwanyas heechea goobiida, ak gayghwanal sean gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
